{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an idle game with rich skill development and upgrade elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a mysterious cube placed in the center of the island. Click on it~ No matter why. Lead your little rock figures and attack it! Every time you hit it, the cube will pour out all kinds of rare items like a treasure, which will become the cornerstone of the tribe's development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561030/extras/7f1e625400bebf32251f3b62e2f194d7.poster.avif?t=1757138248\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561030/extras/7f1e625400bebf32251f3b62e2f194d7.webm?t=1757138248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561030/extras/7f1e625400bebf32251f3b62e2f194d7.mp4?t=1757138248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Little Rock Figures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The little rock figures each have a unique mission. The porters are responsible for collecting the precious dropped items; the boxers are incredibly strong and attack the mysterious cube. Little figures of different occupations unlock skills, upgrade talents, and keep growing along their respective career planning routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561030/extras/3b7aac14dae4071918e01884f5469967.poster.avif?t=1757138248\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561030/extras/3b7aac14dae4071918e01884f5469967.webm?t=1757138248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561030/extras/3b7aac14dae4071918e01884f5469967.mp4?t=1757138248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Rock Tribe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, rare items are skillfully processed and manufactured into various props to assist the adventures and construction of the little rock figures. The Stone Altar can provide a rich selection of talent combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561030/extras/4c4e04749e41a61e3849589574e6faa0.poster.avif?t=1757138248\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561030/extras/4c4e04749e41a61e3849589574e6faa0.webm?t=1757138248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561030/extras/4c4e04749e41a61e3849589574e6faa0.mp4?t=1757138248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and explore as many resources as possible, and choose efficient collection methods and skill synergy effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561030/extras/74db4cbc202fe386ea83a01b009fd27a.avif?t=1757138248\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exquisite pixel art presentation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a surprising experience different from ordinary idle games, with rich and diverse growth paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically choose talent skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Provide challenge items to unlock special abilities</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561030?t=1757138248","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561030?t=1757138248","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561030/4a189a2c213a4f0640c4c08fb050a2652d82410c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757138248","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561030/4a189a2c213a4f0640c4c08fb050a2652d82410c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757138248","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an idle game with rich skill development and upgrade elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a mysterious cube placed in the center of the island. Click on it~ No matter why. Lead your little rock figures and attack it! Every time you hit it, the cube will pour out all kinds of rare items like a treasure, which will become the cornerstone of the tribe's development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561030/extras/7f1e625400bebf32251f3b62e2f194d7.poster.avif?t=1757138248\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561030/extras/7f1e625400bebf32251f3b62e2f194d7.webm?t=1757138248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561030/extras/7f1e625400bebf32251f3b62e2f194d7.mp4?t=1757138248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Little Rock Figures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The little rock figures each have a unique mission. The porters 